🤖 Agentic DevOps AI Platform 
AI-Powered Monitoring & Intelligent Decision System for Docker & Kubernetes

An intelligent DevOps monitoring platform that observes infrastructure health, analyzes system status using AI, and provides actionable insights for reliability and automation.

📌 1. Problem Statement

Modern DevOps environments include:

Docker containers

Kubernetes clusters

Monitoring & alerting systems

Distributed microservices

Monitoring these systems manually is:

❌ time-consuming
❌ reactive instead of proactive
❌ dependent on human intervention
❌ difficult to correlate issues

💡 Goal

Build an AI-powered agent that:

✅ monitors infrastructure
✅ detects system health issues
✅ analyzes operational state
✅ provides intelligent decisions
✅ enables future automation

🎯 2. Objectives

The platform aims to:

Monitor Docker containers

Monitor Kubernetes cluster health

Check Alertmanager alerts

Aggregate infrastructure status

Use AI reasoning for decision support

Provide a simple dashboard interface

