⚙️ 5. Components Overview
5.1 Streamlit UI (ui/app.py)
Responsibilities:

User interface dashboard

Trigger agent execution

Display system health & logs

Show AI decisions

5.2 Agent Engine (agent/agent.py)

This is the core orchestrator.

Responsibilities:

Run Docker health checks

Run Kubernetes cluster checks

Check Alertmanager alerts

Send results to AI model

Generate decision output

5.3 Docker Monitoring Tool (tools/docker_tool.py)

Uses Docker SDK.

Checks:

Running containers

Container health

Service status

Example Output:
petclinic → running
mysql → running

5.4 Kubernetes Monitoring Tool (tools/k8s_tool.py)

Uses Kubernetes API or kubectl.

Checks:

Node status

Pod health

Cluster readiness

Example Output:
Nodes: Ready
Pods: Running

5.5 Alertmanager Tool (tools/alert_tool.py)

Connects to:

http://localhost:9093/api/v2/alerts

Checks:

Active alerts

Firing alerts

Monitoring health

5.6 AI Decision Layer (Llama3)

The AI model analyzes infrastructure state and generates insights.

Example Capabilities:
Condition	AI Recommendation
container stopped	restart service
node not ready	investigate node
high resource usage	scale workload
alerts firing	notify team
